uCsim sleeps 100 ms in its main loop whenever the simulation is stopped and
no command is waiting (cl_app::run_nogo, after the first 2 s). The tests drive
it one command at a time over its socket, so every command after the first
2 s of a session paid up to 100 ms: a key event took 20-40 s on macOS. Poll
every 1 ms instead. Simulated behaviour is unchanged.

--- a/sim/ucsim/src/core/utils.src/fuio.cc
+++ b/sim/ucsim/src/core/utils.src/fuio.cc
@@ -463,7 +463,7 @@
 void
 loop_delay()
 {
-  msleep(100);
+  msleep(1);
 }
 
 
